{"type":"text","timestamp":1789781622078,"sessionID":"ses_f48b49739ffeYnVr3riqa1ps4R","part":{"id":"prt_0b74c3152001AUZaEt70MaIDMD","messageID":"msg_0b74c2b8f001mfTzzwou3mFKD3","sessionID":"ses_f48b49739ffeYnVr3riqa1ps4R","type":"text","text":"Fixed in `src/search/controller.ts`.\n\n- Added a sequence number for each search so only the latest request can update results, errors, or loading.\n- Clearing the query immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests, preventing late responses from repopulating results.\n- Preserved the public API and normal search behavior.\n\n**Verification:** `npm test` passed all 4 existing tests, and `git diff --check` passed. No tests were modified or dependencies installed.","time":{"start":1789781619026,"end":1789781622077},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_06bdeea685886687016aade67301bc87d1a4c502e312670bee","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
